                // on `no_struct == false`: `gen` is a reserved keyword in edition 2024 (so `gen {` is unambiguous
                // there), but a plain identifier in 2021; the gate keeps `match gen { .. }` scrutinees + any `gen`
                // binding untouched (they parse with no_struct set). Only entered when `gen` is followed by `{` or
                // `move {`, so a bare `gen` value still falls through to the path arm.
