        // stdin larger than the buffer (or delivered in chunks) was silently cut (C-SEM0-PIPED-STDIN-TRUNCATES). LOOP the
        // read into buf+total until read returns 0 (EOF), so an arbitrarily large source (a rustc crate) is read whole.
        // buf/capc/totc are read-only pre-loop vregs (survive the loop like a for-bound); `total` lives in a heap cell.
