    // pushed String::new(), so `for x in v.iter() { match x { n => .. } }` gave `n` the address with NO type
    // and every deref was lost -- measured, `x` printed 7 while `n` printed 24117268. Computed ONCE here and
    // not in the arm loop: C-L6-MOVECHECK forbids a new `env` call inside it.
