            // ONLY macros whose arguments are EXPRESSIONS may be reparsed. Reparsing every macro refused 8
            // tree files -- rustc_macros/*, rustc_index_macros, rustc_parse -- whose macro bodies are token
            // soup (`quote! { .. }`), not expressions. The full-tree run caught it; gates and the witness
            // board were both green, exactly as the standing hazard says of refusal regressions.
