// holds bare idents -- so it could never match and the call was always read as undefined. CT-28: all 6 of the tier's
// tree false-refusals were qualified paths, and `is_lower_ident` said yes to every one of them because it reads only
// the FIRST byte of the whole rendered path (`core::..` begins lowercase).
